{"des":"m_2_3_5","script":"m_2_3_5","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"马可","text":"[show]哦，你们好，我亲爱的朋友，有什么能为你们服务的吗？[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"你的态度真不错。","tag":"tag_3"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"马可","text":"[cm][show]哈，看来你们作为外来者，已经见识到了这个村子的排外风气了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"马可","text":"[show]没办法，这就是我们巴诺姆，永远都是这么愚昧、守旧、故步自封。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"听起来你和他们的意见不太一样？","tag":"tag_6"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"马可","text":"[cm][show]当然！我身为情报商人，对于外界的了解可不是一般的山民能够比得上的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"马可","text":"[show]在他们还在因为出身、态度、纠纷……等等等等，去排斥外来者的时候，我却能看到外来者给山地带来了什么——[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"马可","text":"[show]那是在这个深渊里生存最重要的两样东西：力量，还有资源。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"马可","text":"[show]只有抓住这两点，村子才能摆脱困境，而不是像现在这样停在原地等死！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"你觉得那些外来者可以合作？","tag":"tag_11"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"马可","text":"[cm][show]如果他们能够拯救巴诺姆村，为什么不能给他们一点信任呢？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"马可","text":"[show]虽然他们态度跋扈，也许在山外的名声也不是很好……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"马可","text":"[show]但我们现在面临的情况也不会更加糟糕了，任何改变都是好转，不是么。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"la